## 2. End-to-end registration — the exhaustive checklist

`CmdKind` is `CaseIterable` and there are **two exhaustive switches over it**. Adding an enum case without updating both is a hard compile error. There is no `default:` in either.

### Step 1 — `CmdKind` case
`/Users/bogac/dev/forgejo/AeroSpace/Sources/Common/cmdArgs/cmdArgsManifest.swift` lines 1–53. Kept alphabetically sorted; `rawValue` is the CLI subcommand string (explicit only when it differs from the Swift identifier):

