Constraints on the synopsis block, imposed by the sed pipeline: every usage line must start at column 0 with the literal token `aerospace `; a blank line before `// end::synopsis[]` is required (the script drops the first and last lines of the sed range and strips blanks); continuation lines must be indented by exactly 3 spaces (`____strip_prefix="   "`).

